WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.960
(Inglis, 6 years old)

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.400
(Rafinha, 6 years old)
It's so warm.

00:00:12.029 --> 00:00:13.380
And a bit ticklish.

00:00:13.710 --> 00:00:17.019
Chris, it seems fine.
I'm not afraid!

00:00:17.019 --> 00:00:19.850
Rafinha, please be quiet
during your baptism.

00:00:20.179 --> 00:00:26.059
Baptism is a ritual to receive a Rune
in order to become a knight.

00:00:26.059 --> 00:00:28.160
(Rafael, 14 years old)
Runes are classified into special,

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.059
(Rafael, 14 years old)
high, middle, and low classes.

00:00:31.059 --> 00:00:35.490
The stronger Rune you have,
the stronger Artifact you can control.

00:00:35.909 --> 00:00:38.649
Please check your hand.

00:00:40.399 --> 00:00:42.200
The Bow of Light.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:45.159
Oh! It's a high-class Rune.

00:00:45.159 --> 00:00:48.210
Wow! Look, Chris!

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:49.380
Congratulations!

00:00:49.679 --> 00:00:52.109
Now you'll become a great knight.

00:00:52.109 --> 00:00:53.090
Thanks!

00:00:53.090 --> 00:00:55.969
Next is Miss Inglis.
Please step forward.

00:00:55.969 --> 00:00:56.799
I'm ready!

00:00:57.700 --> 00:01:00.460
I'm sure you'll get a high-class Rune.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.039
Perhaps even a special-class.

00:01:03.039 --> 00:01:04.769
Please, I don't want that.

00:01:06.329 --> 00:01:08.230
Say, Inglis.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:13.439
To tell the truth, I don't want you
to receive the special-class Rune.

00:01:13.780 --> 00:01:14.659
Huh?

00:01:14.659 --> 00:01:20.319
I feel that Rune will bind you to
live and die for other people.

00:01:20.319 --> 00:01:23.909
I, too, was thinking I'd like
anything but special-class.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:25.879
Really?

00:01:25.879 --> 00:01:26.870
Yes.

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:30.840
I don't need power that's going to
dictate how I live.

00:01:31.560 --> 00:01:35.049
That's the path I've taken
in my previous life.

00:01:35.049 --> 00:01:36.510
Your hand, please.

00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.579
Now, I see.

00:01:39.579 --> 00:01:43.950
This is made to imprint
the flow of mana into a Rune.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:47.349
The people of this era are lacking
a sense of manipulating mana.

00:01:47.349 --> 00:01:49.939
That's not because mana has gone,

00:01:49.939 --> 00:01:52.689
but it's because they had forgotten
the technique to utilize it.

00:01:53.370 --> 00:01:57.439
I already saw that if this box
will imprint a Rune to a person,

00:01:57.439 --> 00:01:59.739
letting them infuse mana into
an Artifact and manipulate it.

00:01:59.739 --> 00:02:02.079
But if that's the case...

00:02:02.079 --> 00:02:05.519
It's done.
Please check your hand.

00:02:09.580 --> 00:02:11.560
Nothing happened.

00:02:13.379 --> 00:02:17.710
Impossible! Inglis is a Runeless?!
I can't believe this!

00:02:17.710 --> 00:02:19.509
Something must have gone wrong!

00:02:19.889 --> 00:02:21.900
It's a natural outcome.

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:26.469
As a divine knight,
I'm not in clad of mana but aether.

00:02:26.469 --> 00:02:30.520
It repelled the ability to imprint
the flow of mana.

00:02:31.710 --> 00:02:35.020
Without a Rune,
she can never be a knight.

00:02:35.020 --> 00:02:38.900
Is there no way to make Inglis
succeed the Knights?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.270
Father, I'm sorry to disappoint you.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:46.120
No! You don't!
That's not true, Inglis.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:50.580
Father, Mother, there's plenty
I can do even without a Rune.

00:02:51.110 --> 00:02:53.539
I believe Rani will become
a great knight.

00:02:53.539 --> 00:02:57.590
I could serve at her side as her squire.

00:02:58.669 --> 00:03:03.719
Even without an Artifact,
I can be her shield.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:09.310
This way, I can hone my skills on the front line
without worrying about getting promoted.

00:03:09.770 --> 00:03:11.770
How wonderful!

00:03:11.770 --> 00:03:14.370
I see. You're right.

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:17.000
Take good care of Rafinha, Inglis.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:17.560
Okay!

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.860
Chris, you really are an amazing girl.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:23.020
Chris, I'm so happy!

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.319
This means we can stay
together forever, right?

00:03:25.879 --> 00:03:28.979
Well, I'm feeling a bit uneasy though.

00:03:44.090 --> 00:03:46.849
(Reborn to Master the Blade:
From Hero-King to Extraordinary Squire)

00:03:46.849 --> 00:03:52.520
♫I carve the prayer that was given to me♫

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:58.939
♫in the depth of my memory♫

00:03:58.939 --> 00:04:01.360
♫so it can't be hurt♫

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:02.699
♫Let's start again♫

00:04:02.699 --> 00:04:04.870
♫Go beyond destiny♫

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.780
♫I will take it over!♫

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:13.000
♫To live my life in this world♫

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.589
♫I'll keep reaching my hands out♫

00:04:17.209 --> 00:04:22.550
♫We're dreaming,
but remember it to make sure♫

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:24.259
♫we're no longer lost♫

00:04:24.259 --> 00:04:27.930
♫Let your heart beat and wish for the sky♫

00:04:27.930 --> 00:04:30.970
♫so we could grasp
the future we believed in♫

00:04:30.970 --> 00:04:35.939
♫Every time you get up,
look around and see where you are♫

00:04:35.939 --> 00:04:38.730
♫And rewrite the common sense♫

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:42.899
♫This is a story that starts from scratch♫

00:04:42.899 --> 00:04:47.240
♫Running on the endless road♫

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:54.329
♫We're aiming for
a world we've never seen before♫

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:00.870
(Episode 2: Meeting With a Hieral Menace)

00:05:00.879 --> 00:05:02.779
Prism Flow.

00:05:02.779 --> 00:05:05.300
Although it does not affect humans,

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:09.290
exposure to this rainbow-colored rain
could transform flora and fauna,

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:14.610
or livestock into magicite beasts
that will attack humans.

00:05:16.529 --> 00:05:22.990
Among them, there is Prismer,
the King of Rainbow,

00:05:22.990 --> 00:05:27.449
the strongest magicite beast that
could destroy a country by itself.

00:05:28.250 --> 00:05:32.120
Geez, I've gone to the trouble of taking
part in magicite beast subjugation,

00:05:32.120 --> 00:05:33.420
but all I got was small fries.

00:05:33.879 --> 00:05:37.170
When can I expect to engage
with a Prismer?

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:41.879
They haven't been showing up for
two or three decades in Ymir.

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:46.100
But I've heard they appeared in
the neighboring country recently.

00:05:46.240 --> 00:05:48.759
(Inglis, 12 years old)
I'd like to go on an expedition.

00:05:48.759 --> 00:05:51.310
(Rafinha, 12 years old)
Really? That's scary.

00:05:51.639 --> 00:05:54.990
You want to find out if they can only
be defeated by holy knights, don't you?

00:05:54.990 --> 00:05:57.769
Chris, you're too extreme.

00:05:57.769 --> 00:06:01.129
More! Rain more!
And give me strong magicite beasts!

00:06:01.129 --> 00:06:05.750
No! Give birth to a Prismer
so I can practice my skills!

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.269
What's wrong, Rani?

00:06:09.269 --> 00:06:10.949
How can a beautiful girl like you

00:06:10.949 --> 00:06:14.339
be strong enough to defeat
a magicite beast without a Rune?

00:06:14.339 --> 00:06:17.220
Heaven really gave you
two or three blessings, didn't it?

00:06:17.220 --> 00:06:19.759
It's supposed to be our secret.

00:06:19.759 --> 00:06:21.220
Yeah, I know.

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.139
The rain has stopped.

00:06:29.370 --> 00:06:30.660
It's the Highland!

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.310
We haven't seen that in a long time.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:37.639
Highland is inhabited by people
known as Highlanders.

00:06:37.639 --> 00:06:42.029
Artifacts and baptismal tabernacles
were made by people there.

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:47.800
Highland provided Artifacts for countries
on the lower land to protect their living

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.990
from the threat of the magicite beasts.

00:06:50.560 --> 00:06:56.610
In return, countries on the lower land offered
huge amounts of crops and materials.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:58.709
It did not exist in my previous life.

00:06:59.319 --> 00:07:05.680
And yet, I wonder what happened to
the Silvare Kingdom after my death.

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:10.139
I couldn't find any information about it
how many books I read through.

00:07:10.139 --> 00:07:12.160
What are you doing, Rani?

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:15.850
They say your wish will come true
if you see the Highland.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.149
That's just a superstition.

00:07:18.149 --> 00:07:20.899
It's fine. Let's say just in case.

00:07:20.899 --> 00:07:23.569
Come on, why don't you
wish for something too?

00:07:25.029 --> 00:07:26.529
Fine, then.

00:07:26.959 --> 00:07:31.029
I wish my brother is doing well
in the royal capital.

00:07:31.029 --> 00:07:31.990
What did you wish for?

00:07:32.430 --> 00:07:35.829
I wish I could fight a tough,
strong enemy!

00:07:36.699 --> 00:07:41.959
Chris, you really have the soul of
a warlord within your angelic body.

00:07:42.439 --> 00:07:44.420
You bet.

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:47.680
Why don't you make a more lady-like wish?

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.389
Such as, "I want a wonderful boyfriend."

00:07:50.389 --> 00:07:51.389
I don't want it!

00:07:51.399 --> 00:07:54.110
- That's not going to happen.
- My soul is still an old man, you know!

00:07:54.529 --> 00:07:55.620
You're right!

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:59.160
I don't want you to be in love with
someone I don't know either.

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:02.069
The only person I'd approve of
is my brother Rafa.

00:08:02.459 --> 00:08:04.779
What a terrifying thing!

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:13.389
Looks like my appearance
is developing favorably.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:17.410
Chris, are you ready?

00:08:18.730 --> 00:08:20.889
You look incredibly mature!

00:08:20.889 --> 00:08:23.379
You really are beautiful!

00:08:23.379 --> 00:08:26.420
Look at you too.
It suits you and is pretty.

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:29.839
I think I'm just a sideshow if
I walk alongside you.

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:33.480
That's not true.
You look charming!

00:08:33.480 --> 00:08:40.559
I'm impressed with how much
that little Rani has grown.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:43.820
Perhaps I've been watching you
since you were a baby.

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:46.690
Is this what's called parental love?

00:08:48.429 --> 00:08:52.179
So, there's a Highlander coming along
with an inspector from royal capital?

00:08:52.179 --> 00:08:54.990
Yeah, I heard it from my father.

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:58.600
The inspection itself is carried out
every two or three years,

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.960
but this is the first time
a Highlander is coming along.

00:09:02.809 --> 00:09:04.960
They said he's coming to
the banquet too.

00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:09.539
I didn't know a Highlander would
accompany a royal inspector.

00:09:10.970 --> 00:09:13.070
At least in this country,

00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:16.480
there is still a functioning
ruling class of royalty and nobility.

00:09:17.639 --> 00:09:23.009
It would be believable that Highland wants
to eliminate them and control us directly.

00:09:23.559 --> 00:09:26.870
Could this banquet be a sign of that?

00:09:26.870 --> 00:09:29.360
Oh no, a habit of my previous life...

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.320
Everyone's looking at you, Chris!

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.009
Huh?

00:09:32.009 --> 00:09:33.080
Oh my, she's beautiful!

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.789
- How lovely!
- She's like something out of a picture!

00:09:35.789 --> 00:09:37.950
Rani, let me hold you for a while.

00:09:38.549 --> 00:09:40.909
Forget about the women.

00:09:41.669 --> 00:09:45.879
But those lust-filled stares of men
are so painful.

00:09:47.029 --> 00:09:48.470
In my previous life,

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:52.840
I could've been gawped at my beautiful
daughters at a banquet, too.

00:09:52.840 --> 00:09:56.980
I wonder if this is how they felt
at the time.

00:09:56.980 --> 00:09:59.259
It was very rude of me.

00:09:59.259 --> 00:10:01.860
I know it's late, but I regret it.

00:10:01.860 --> 00:10:03.440
Father!

00:10:05.019 --> 00:10:06.340
Your Grace.

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:10.070
Oh! You two deserve to become
the centerpieces in this banquet.

00:10:10.659 --> 00:10:12.220
Let me introduce you.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:15.870
This is Rafinha my daughter,
and she is Inglis my niece.

00:10:16.149 --> 00:10:17.190
Oh!

00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:20.830
You must be the lovely little sisters
Rafael mentioned.

00:10:21.129 --> 00:10:22.250
Glad to meet you.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:23.789
This is Sir Leon.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:28.250
He works as a holy knight with Rafael.

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.710
A holy knight?!

00:10:30.120 --> 00:10:31.669
Yup, sort of.

00:10:32.279 --> 00:10:34.539
Sorry, I'm the one here tonight.

00:10:34.539 --> 00:10:39.289
Originally, this mission should be handled
by Rafael so he could come home,

00:10:39.289 --> 00:10:41.139
but he's so busy right now.

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:44.559
This is the inspector, Lord Shiony.

00:10:44.559 --> 00:10:48.110
It's an honor to meet
such beautiful ladies.

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.919
And this is the ambassador from Highland.

00:10:50.919 --> 00:10:54.259
Hey, long time no see.

00:10:56.620 --> 00:10:57.990
Inglis.

00:10:58.399 --> 00:11:00.450
Rahl?

00:11:07.750 --> 00:11:10.159
He's the ambassador from Highland?

00:11:11.720 --> 00:11:13.379
What is the meaning of this?

00:11:13.809 --> 00:11:18.230
You seem to be wondering
why I'm a Highlander now.

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.899
However, this stigmata is the proof.

00:11:20.899 --> 00:11:23.350
I'm absolutely a real Highlander.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:27.529
So you can become a Highlander
without being born in Highland?

00:11:27.529 --> 00:11:28.759
Sure can.

00:11:28.759 --> 00:11:32.740
Give them a significant contribution
and citizenship is yours.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:33.990
Contribution?

00:11:35.269 --> 00:11:37.480
It's money.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:41.529
I gave almost all of my profits
to the Highland.

00:11:42.129 --> 00:11:46.000
Still, you do need some connections
with upper Highlanders.

00:11:46.429 --> 00:11:49.789
Offered all of my profit is
a small price to pay.

00:11:49.789 --> 00:11:54.669
Since a Highlander practically has more
authority than any noble on the lower land.

00:11:55.159 --> 00:11:58.769
I'm not particularly interested in that.

00:11:58.769 --> 00:12:01.450
Then what are you interested in?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.139
I see you grew up really pretty.

00:12:05.600 --> 00:12:08.289
Don't stare me like that, geez.

00:12:08.289 --> 00:12:10.309
Honing my skills.

00:12:10.309 --> 00:12:14.769
Come on, I believe you're Runeless.

00:12:15.149 --> 00:12:17.240
What's the point of honing your skills?

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:21.490
Oh, right! There's someone else
I'd like you to meet.

00:12:21.899 --> 00:12:23.850
Let's go see her!

00:12:23.850 --> 00:12:26.460
Sir Leon, who are we going to meet?

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:31.460
Well, if there's a holy knight,
what else do you have?

00:12:32.059 --> 00:12:34.919
Do you mean the ultimate Artifact?

00:12:34.919 --> 00:12:38.929
Right, it's a hieral menace.
You girls adore them, don't you?

00:12:38.929 --> 00:12:40.879
We want to meet her!

00:12:40.879 --> 00:12:42.639
Good! Follow me!

00:12:42.639 --> 00:12:43.879
'Kay!

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:49.570
I wonder if all Highlanders
are like that.

00:12:49.570 --> 00:12:52.639
Well, pretty much like that.

00:12:52.639 --> 00:12:57.690
From the Highlanders' point of view,
we're just an inferior race

00:12:57.690 --> 00:13:01.159
who can't protect our homes if
they don't provide Artifacts.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:05.529
They're the ones holding our lifeline.

00:13:05.529 --> 00:13:06.610
Correct.

00:13:06.610 --> 00:13:11.269
So you'd better put on a smile
in front of them.

00:13:11.269 --> 00:13:14.309
I've gotta do plenty of ass-kissing them.

00:13:14.309 --> 00:13:16.750
I'll even lick their shoes if I have to.

00:13:16.750 --> 00:13:17.990
Just kidding.

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:20.970
I wish a holy knight wouldn't
say such a thing.

00:13:22.409 --> 00:13:23.429
Rani?

00:13:23.789 --> 00:13:29.019
Aren't holy knights everyone's hope
who protect this country and its people?

00:13:29.019 --> 00:13:34.399
Who does the weak have left to rely on
if that's what you say?

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:38.649
That stings. I'm sorry.
The joke went too far.

00:13:39.269 --> 00:13:42.610
My apologies!
I didn't mean to insult you.

00:13:43.159 --> 00:13:44.629
It's fine.

00:13:44.629 --> 00:13:48.580
You're definitely Rafael's little sister.
You got me there.

00:13:49.230 --> 00:13:52.360
There she is!
Let's say hello.

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:54.000
Hieral menaces.

00:13:54.840 --> 00:13:59.090
They are entities with the ability to
transform into special-class Artifacts.

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:04.289
They are the only countermeasure
to defeat the Prismer.

00:14:06.519 --> 00:14:07.950
Hey, Eris.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:11.559
Why be gloomy out here when
you could be having fun inside?

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:14.429
I'm here because I don't want to.

00:14:14.429 --> 00:14:16.019
Don't mind me.

00:14:16.309 --> 00:14:19.580
Come on, don't be like that.
I bring girls who want to meet you.

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:20.759
Why me?

00:14:20.759 --> 00:14:25.490
Those are Rafael's sister and cousin,
Rafinha and Inglis.

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:29.269
Pleased to meet you, I'm Raf...

00:14:29.909 --> 00:14:31.690
You fool! Stop it!

00:14:31.690 --> 00:14:33.370
Ouch!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.789
Why did you hit me?

00:14:35.789 --> 00:14:38.590
They wanted to meet you.

00:14:38.590 --> 00:14:40.289
I'm sorry.

00:14:40.289 --> 00:14:41.860
Um...

00:14:42.460 --> 00:14:45.509
Did we do something bad?

00:14:45.509 --> 00:14:48.210
Should we apologise to her?

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.990
Nah, it's fine.

00:14:49.990 --> 00:14:52.019
You did nothing wrong.

00:14:52.309 --> 00:14:55.230
I guess I couldn't pick up on the mood.

00:14:55.629 --> 00:14:57.700
Sorry to scare you like that.

00:14:57.700 --> 00:15:01.190
All right! I can tell you about
how Rafael's doing...

00:15:01.830 --> 00:15:03.149
What's going on?

00:15:08.460 --> 00:15:10.490
Don't tell me, this is...

00:15:10.490 --> 00:15:12.039
It's Lord Shiony.

00:15:12.669 --> 00:15:14.000
What happened here?

00:15:14.000 --> 00:15:16.710
I was just giving an insolent man
a lesson, that's all.

00:15:17.210 --> 00:15:20.669
Because he wasn't showing a Highlander
the proper respect.

00:15:20.669 --> 00:15:23.200
It's my fault.

00:15:23.200 --> 00:15:25.620
It's my fault that Lord Shiony...

00:15:25.620 --> 00:15:27.129
What's going on really?

00:15:27.129 --> 00:15:31.580
Sir Rahl ordered me to be
his companion for the night.

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:36.100
When I hesitated,
Lord Shiony came to my defense.

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:41.179
Sir Rahl created a flame
from nothing, and then...

00:15:41.179 --> 00:15:42.649
From nothing?

00:15:42.649 --> 00:15:45.750
In other words,
the way they couldn't sense.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.139
Magic, huh?

00:15:47.139 --> 00:15:50.370
He used magic in our sparring before.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:53.759
Probably it was given by
the Highlander back then.

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.039
Oh, man, what a mess.

00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:00.250
Just tell them that he died of
a sudden illness.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:04.529
My word as a Highlander
is as good as gold.

00:16:04.529 --> 00:16:06.029
I guess so.

00:16:06.029 --> 00:16:11.470
His Majesty can't argue with a Highlander,
even if wanted to.

00:16:11.799 --> 00:16:14.870
Meaning, of course, Duke Bilford,

00:16:14.870 --> 00:16:20.519
whether Lord Shiony died of a sudden illness
or whether he was assassinated by your plot,

00:16:20.519 --> 00:16:22.289
it's entirely up to me.

00:16:23.399 --> 00:16:25.690
I'm sure you understand
what I'm trying to say.

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:31.409
Now, order that woman knight
to do exactly as I say!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:35.370
Sell out your soldier to save yourself.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:37.149
How dare you...

00:16:37.149 --> 00:16:38.580
Father...

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:41.789
Rahl, you're twisted.

00:16:41.789 --> 00:16:42.799
Huh?

00:16:42.799 --> 00:16:44.250
You know, I...

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:46.830
despise you.

00:16:48.700 --> 00:16:52.350
Don't get full of yourself
just because you beat me once.

00:16:52.350 --> 00:16:54.110
You want me to appoint you
to take her pl...

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:55.360
I don't mind if you do.

00:16:56.379 --> 00:16:58.889
Chris, what are you thinking?

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:01.750
Rahl has a grudge against me.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.359
I'm sure he'd try to after me
at some point.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.220
Then it should have been me,
to begin with.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.319
But, wait...

00:17:08.759 --> 00:17:13.029
Promise me you won't lay a finger
on Rani or her.

00:17:13.559 --> 00:17:14.579
Good enough.

00:17:14.579 --> 00:17:17.599
Then come to the villa
where I'm staying tonight.

00:17:17.599 --> 00:17:19.000
Come alone.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:23.339
She shattered my pride back then.

00:17:23.339 --> 00:17:26.839
This time I'll conquer her,
and make her yield to me.

00:17:28.599 --> 00:17:31.380
It's do-or-die, I guess.

00:17:31.380 --> 00:17:34.190
Now that Rahl has magic which
can burn Lord Shiony to death,

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:38.559
I hope he's become stronger and tougher.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:41.690
Aren't you...

00:17:42.759 --> 00:17:44.230
Eris?

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:46.190
Run away.

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.230
Huh?

00:17:47.230 --> 00:17:48.950
I heard it from Leon.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:51.150
Did you come to save me?

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:55.910
You're Rafael's cousin, right?
I can't let anything happen to you.

00:17:56.440 --> 00:17:58.619
Thank you for your consideration.

00:17:59.079 --> 00:18:04.069
But there's no telling what
Rahl would do if I don't show.

00:18:04.079 --> 00:18:06.630
You need to take better care of yourself!

00:18:06.630 --> 00:18:08.589
I'll do something to handle him.

00:18:08.869 --> 00:18:13.549
Do what?
Do you plan to assassinate Rahl?

00:18:13.880 --> 00:18:17.059
Think of what will happen to Ymir
after that.

00:18:17.059 --> 00:18:19.720
It's none of your concern.

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.380
Just go home!

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.019
Not a chance.

00:18:23.019 --> 00:18:24.920
You're a naughty kid.

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:29.079
If you try to take a step forward,

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:31.440
I'll attack.

00:18:31.440 --> 00:18:35.410
It's a shame of me as a hieral menace
to threaten a mere girl,

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:36.730
but I have no choice.

00:18:41.619 --> 00:18:43.440
Thank you very much!

00:18:43.440 --> 00:18:46.079
That means you'll fight me?

00:18:46.430 --> 00:18:49.289
Well, then, let's get on with it!

00:18:50.019 --> 00:18:52.869
Having a fight with a hieral menace...

00:18:52.869 --> 00:18:56.259
This is a great opportunity
to test my current skills!

00:18:56.609 --> 00:18:58.630
You fool! What are you thinking?

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:00.660
Wasn't this your idea?

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:02.220
Yeah, but...

00:19:02.509 --> 00:19:05.190
Is she a bit confused?

00:19:05.190 --> 00:19:06.440
No wonder.

00:19:07.150 --> 00:19:10.059
I guess I'll have to surprise her
so she'll go home.

00:19:13.819 --> 00:19:15.529
That's what I'd expect!

00:19:15.529 --> 00:19:20.490
I couldn't find this speed, flexibility,
and agility in the Knights!

00:19:20.490 --> 00:19:23.140
However, she hasn't given her best!

00:19:24.029 --> 00:19:26.410
Why do you look so happy?

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:30.000
Because I love to fight
with someone strong!

00:19:30.329 --> 00:19:32.210
What a troublesome personality!

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:34.779
How come?

00:19:34.779 --> 00:19:37.279
My attacks should have
the same level as holy knights',

00:19:37.279 --> 00:19:40.269
yet she can fend it off
even without Rune or Artifact.

00:19:40.269 --> 00:19:42.680
Who is she really?

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.390
You need to get more serious!

00:19:45.849 --> 00:19:46.769
I already am!

00:19:52.730 --> 00:19:57.079
That's a hieral menace for you.
This is getting interesting.

00:19:57.079 --> 00:19:59.349
Makes it worth fighting for.

00:19:59.349 --> 00:20:00.769
Are you okay?

00:20:00.769 --> 00:20:01.740
Huh?

00:20:01.740 --> 00:20:03.509
It wasn't my intent to...

00:20:03.509 --> 00:20:05.829
Don't ask me that.

00:20:05.829 --> 00:20:08.180
Am I not worthy to fight for?

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.960
It's not that, just...

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:15.170
Uh... Eris, can a hieral menace
sense mana?

00:20:15.549 --> 00:20:18.460
Why would you care about that?

00:20:18.460 --> 00:20:22.390
People on the lower land shouldn't be
able to sense mana in the first place.

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:24.670
Don't mind about that part.

00:20:25.460 --> 00:20:27.269
Just answer me.

00:20:27.269 --> 00:20:29.849
Yes, I can. To an extent.

00:20:29.849 --> 00:20:31.809
Glad to hear that!

00:20:31.809 --> 00:20:33.269
Well, then...

00:20:33.529 --> 00:20:37.240
I'm going to show you a certain technique
that I've been training recently.

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:41.700
Recomposite aether in my body,
and convert it into mana.

00:20:46.430 --> 00:20:47.619
What's this?!

00:20:48.329 --> 00:20:53.579
If she can sense mana,
that means she can witness my power.

00:20:53.859 --> 00:20:56.759
How can Runeless like you control mana?

00:20:56.759 --> 00:20:59.049
Do you understand now?

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.009
You don't have to hold back.

00:21:01.589 --> 00:21:06.970
Right. I guess you don't need my help.

00:21:07.900 --> 00:21:10.099
I won't stop you. Go ahead.

00:21:10.099 --> 00:21:13.440
Huh?! Please wait!
That's too much!

00:21:14.119 --> 00:21:15.509
What?

00:21:15.509 --> 00:21:19.150
If you have that much mana,
you can protect yourself, can't you?

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.609
Why it has to come like this?
What have I done?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:27.059
I'm a frail girl!
Please, stop me!

00:21:27.059 --> 00:21:28.079
Don't lie!

00:21:28.599 --> 00:21:31.109
You can go. Better not to keep
Mr Highlander waiting.

00:21:31.799 --> 00:21:35.539
I should've never done that.
What a blunder.

00:21:42.869 --> 00:21:44.049
Eris!

00:21:45.329 --> 00:21:47.509
What are you thinking?

00:21:47.930 --> 00:21:49.970
Show me yourself, Leon!

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:52.640
Of course, you figured me out.

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.859
Sir Leon?

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:30.029
♫Once I wake up, I already win♫

00:22:31.160 --> 00:22:34.079
♫I deserve a theme song♫

00:22:34.079 --> 00:22:38.210
♫That was today's first step♫

00:22:41.630 --> 00:22:45.299
♫Preparing before a stroll is important♫

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:52.180
♫♫I look good no matter what I wear

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:56.930
♫I don't need to bring anything
other than confidence♫

00:22:56.930 --> 00:22:59.559
♫Self-hug & big love♫

00:22:59.559 --> 00:23:03.190
♫I want to stay as my favorite self♫

00:23:03.190 --> 00:23:07.440
♫(I will take me everywhere)♫

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:15.200
♫Do I look unscathed as I fight?♫

00:23:15.200 --> 00:23:21.250
♫I'd like to hug this fine body♫

00:23:21.250 --> 00:23:23.960
♫It doesn't have to be sparkling♫

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.549
♫It doesn't have to be gorgeous♫

00:23:26.549 --> 00:23:32.430
♫I just need to not forget my big love♫

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:50.029
(I'm sure a wedding dress suits you, Chris.)
(Illustration: Kuromura Moto)
